.TH AVR\-BILLING\-SUMMARY 1 "" "avr 0.1.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-billing-summary \- Show billing summary for the organization.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr billing summary
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show billing summary for the organization.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    billing_emails, default_payment_method, has_billing
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-billing (1),
.BR avr-billing-invoices (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods (1),
.BR avr-billing-settings (1),
.BR avr-billing-update-settings (1)
